1
00:00:53,060 --> 00:00:56,280
I'll take my hand and pull out the light.

2
00:00:56,920 --> 00:01:02,100
I'll take my hand and turn on the light.

3
00:01:04,460 --> 00:01:07,780
I'm the one who's for you.

4
00:01:08,240 --> 00:01:13,297
I'm the one who's for you.

5
00:01:13,380 --> 00:01:15,620
I'm drawing my hand and paint my face.

6
00:01:30,240 --> 00:01:34,828
I really should get to those samurai
before someone else steals all the glory.

7
00:01:35,900 --> 00:01:37,640
It's time to get serious.

8
00:01:37,940 --> 00:01:40,999
A little hands-on time and
he'll melt in an instant.

9
00:01:42,480 --> 00:01:47,740
Ready to broadcast his message all over
the island, Cayman lady? Yes, ma 'am.

10
00:01:48,440 --> 00:01:49,675
All right, black leg.

11
00:01:49,800 --> 00:01:52,800
I'm very busy, so time for
you to call Nico Robin.

12
00:01:54,500 --> 00:01:57,912
You don't want to keep my girls
waiting all night, do you?

13
00:01:58,440 --> 00:02:01,028
We've set up a very
elaborate trap, you see.

14
00:02:01,360 --> 00:02:05,500
My webs, hard gum I call them,
are lining the entrance in layers.

15
00:02:06,720 --> 00:02:08,437
They're lining the floor, too.

16
00:02:08,520 --> 00:02:11,180
So one step inside and you're stuck.

17
00:02:11,860 --> 00:02:16,320
My subordinates are waiting with
tranquilizer guns to fire on my prey.

18
00:02:18,520 --> 00:02:20,080
The rest is up to you.

19
00:02:27,520 --> 00:02:29,920
So call Nico Robin or I'll make you pay!

20
00:02:35,200 --> 00:02:36,200
Come on!

21
00:02:36,600 --> 00:02:38,140
I'm in a hurry here!

22
00:02:38,520 --> 00:02:41,160
I need to go finish off those samurai!

23
00:02:44,140 --> 00:02:44,970
Robin.

24
00:02:47,720 --> 00:02:51,300
What I want is to join you. What?

25
00:02:52,360 --> 00:02:53,190
I...

26
00:02:54,240 --> 00:02:55,070
I...

27
00:02:57,040 --> 00:02:59,000
I want to live!

28
00:03:04,600 --> 00:03:05,920
Stubborn, aren't you?

29
00:03:09,080 --> 00:03:09,910
Come!

30
00:03:09,993 --> 00:03:11,720
Come on! Come on!

31
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:13,020
Oh, Sam!

32
00:03:13,400 --> 00:03:14,900
I can hardly watch me!

33
00:03:15,040 --> 00:03:16,180
What a pretty man!

34
00:03:16,520 --> 00:03:18,696
He'd do anything to save his courage!

35
00:03:19,160 --> 00:03:21,680
Now he'll die without saying a word!

36
00:03:22,320 --> 00:03:25,740
He's still in my heart! But
he'll ask! He's our fault!

37
00:03:26,620 --> 00:03:27,460
Wait! No!

38
00:03:36,140 --> 00:03:37,600
You want me to talk?

39
00:03:38,520 --> 00:03:39,760
All right, then.

40
00:03:39,960 --> 00:03:41,260
I've got a few words.

41
00:03:42,180 --> 00:03:45,520
He's going to say something like,

42
00:03:47,600 --> 00:03:49,540
Blackleg, don't do it!

43
00:03:50,120 --> 00:03:51,826
He'll really make you suffer.

44
00:03:52,420 --> 00:03:54,260
Robin, I'm sorry.

45
00:03:54,920 --> 00:03:57,700
It looks like this is it for me.

46
00:03:58,260 --> 00:04:01,460
I wish I could have seen
you smile one last time.

47
00:04:07,660 --> 00:04:09,320
Help me Robin!

48
00:04:09,780 --> 00:04:11,060
Help me please!

49
00:04:17,100 --> 00:04:20,360
He called her for help after all that!

50
00:04:23,500 --> 00:04:26,460
I'm on the third floor
in the banquet hall!

51
00:04:28,520 --> 00:04:29,350
No!

52
00:04:29,433 --> 00:04:30,263
I've been taken hostage!

53
00:04:30,346 --> 00:04:32,380
I'm sorry! Sanji.

54
00:04:32,960 --> 00:04:36,460
They said if you don't come
here soon, they'll kill me!

55
00:04:36,840 --> 00:04:38,820
My life is in your hands!

56
00:04:39,040 --> 00:04:40,960
Please, come rescue me!

57
00:04:41,760 --> 00:04:42,590
Pathetic.

58
00:04:42,673 --> 00:04:44,600
Put the bastard out of his misery.

59
00:04:44,860 --> 00:04:46,597
One of the star hats is in trouble!

60
00:04:46,680 --> 00:04:47,510
Oh, no!

61
00:04:47,593 --> 00:04:48,423
A broadcast?

62
00:04:48,780 --> 00:04:51,368
They must want all of
Onigashima to hear it.

63
00:04:55,600 --> 00:04:59,037
Nico Robin is one of the most
important figures in the world.

64
00:04:59,120 --> 00:05:02,355
Of course, it figures that
they're after her knowledge.

65
00:05:04,960 --> 00:05:08,078
Sounds like they're trying
to lead Robin into a trap.

66
00:05:09,240 --> 00:05:12,769
It's one thing for a man to cry
if that's downright whining.

67
00:05:20,140 --> 00:05:22,200
Those Straw Hats are one of a kind.

68
00:05:22,460 --> 00:05:25,166
I bet a woman got him
and he won't fight back.

69
00:05:25,340 --> 00:05:26,220
Go figure.

70
00:05:27,040 --> 00:05:28,960
Hey, Nami! Sanji's voice!

71
00:05:29,120 --> 00:05:30,649
It's coming from that cat!

72
00:05:30,900 --> 00:05:31,780
Be careful!

73
00:05:32,160 --> 00:05:33,260
I saw one earlier.

74
00:05:33,920 --> 00:05:36,117
They all have that
weird eye on their face.

75
00:05:36,200 --> 00:05:37,520
I'm begging you!

76
00:05:38,120 --> 00:05:38,950
Robin!

77
00:05:47,060 --> 00:05:48,760
I can't believe it.

78
00:05:54,280 --> 00:05:56,140
Alright, I called for Robin.

79
00:05:56,640 --> 00:05:58,500
Keep your word. Untie me.

80
00:06:03,060 --> 00:06:06,117
Someone's here, and it sounds
like we're under attack.

81
00:06:06,200 --> 00:06:07,620
Well, that was fast.

82
00:06:07,920 --> 00:06:09,080
You're so naive.

83
00:06:09,480 --> 00:06:10,951
You think I'd let you go?

84
00:06:11,700 --> 00:06:14,280
If I recall, you said you loved me, right?

85
00:06:14,920 --> 00:06:17,626
That means this matter
isn't business anymore.

86
00:06:17,800 --> 00:06:19,040
It's personal.

87
00:06:19,860 --> 00:06:21,500
You can be my precious pet.

88
00:06:21,740 --> 00:06:24,446
You'll fit in with the
rest of them perfectly.

89
00:06:29,860 --> 00:06:33,220
I'll make your body
unable to live without me.

90
00:06:33,760 --> 00:06:36,780
We love you and you
alone, Lady Black Maria.

91
00:06:38,380 --> 00:06:39,210
Impossible.

92
00:06:39,293 --> 00:06:41,640
Because I want to love all the ladies!

93
00:06:42,100 --> 00:06:43,900
Being unfaithful already?

94
00:06:44,280 --> 00:06:46,940
Then you'll have to be PUNISHED! Hold on!

95
00:06:47,160 --> 00:06:49,400
I don't want to hurt a lady's fist!

96
00:06:49,660 --> 00:06:51,520
I'll drop my armament, Haki!

97
00:06:53,000 --> 00:06:54,520
Mille Fleurs, go!

98
00:06:58,260 --> 00:06:59,090
Gigantatamano!

99
00:06:59,760 --> 00:07:00,880
And space!

100
00:07:07,260 --> 00:07:08,260
My lady!

101
00:07:18,580 --> 00:07:20,580
How did you manage to get in here?

102
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:26,280
My flowers can bloom anywhere.

103
00:07:28,240 --> 00:07:30,240
You dare to slap my face!

104
00:07:30,980 --> 00:07:32,580
That wasn't much of a plan.

105
00:07:32,920 --> 00:07:36,317
You thought I'd walk straight into
your trap just because Sanji called me?

106
00:07:36,400 --> 00:07:38,840
I'm so glad you're here!

107
00:07:46,500 --> 00:07:49,880
I was part of an evil
organization for quite a while.

108
00:07:50,500 --> 00:07:53,820
So I can't help but show
my devilish side sometimes.

109
00:07:55,220 --> 00:07:58,691
Especially if someone is foolish
enough to harm my friends.

110
00:08:04,680 --> 00:08:09,268
I beg your pardon, just passing through
with the cold gales of the underworld.

111
00:08:15,900 --> 00:08:19,637
Bad news, our entire ambush
unit has been taken out.

112
00:08:19,720 --> 00:08:21,277
The traps were destroyed too.

113
00:08:21,360 --> 00:08:23,713
He froze the threads and shattered them.

114
00:08:25,300 --> 00:08:27,737
I'm a bit surprised it
turned out quite so well.

115
00:08:27,820 --> 00:08:31,020
Well, the wicked winds of
hell know no bounds. Yuh-ho?

116
00:08:35,840 --> 00:08:36,800
You're scarier!

117
00:08:38,180 --> 00:08:39,780
Oh, you're one to talk!

118
00:08:40,880 --> 00:08:41,760
Thanks, Rook.

119
00:08:42,140 --> 00:08:44,257
I think you might have saved my life.

120
00:08:44,340 --> 00:08:45,840
Anytime and anyplace.

121
00:08:46,560 --> 00:08:47,580
I hate to say it.

122
00:08:47,740 --> 00:08:51,328
I'd be better off helping Kin'emon
and the others on the roof.

123
00:08:52,980 --> 00:08:56,300
For some reason, I feel like
I just can't win this one.

124
00:08:56,860 --> 00:08:58,077
You're right about that.

125
00:08:58,160 --> 00:08:59,336
Come back, Blackleg!

126
00:08:59,540 --> 00:09:01,260
You were meant to be my pet!

127
00:09:01,540 --> 00:09:03,080
I won't let you go!

128
00:09:03,640 --> 00:09:04,940
Any last words?

129
00:09:09,720 --> 00:09:10,960
Or is that it?

130
00:09:17,840 --> 00:09:20,877
Why are you protecting that
idiot when he sold you out?

131
00:09:20,960 --> 00:09:23,037
You really think he's worth your life?

132
00:09:23,120 --> 00:09:24,160
How sad.

133
00:09:24,340 --> 00:09:25,297
You don't have friends.

134
00:09:25,380 --> 00:09:29,220
If you did, you would
surely understand. Huh?

135
00:09:31,740 --> 00:09:34,500
It's a fine thing, trusting someone.

136
00:09:36,640 --> 00:09:37,470
Sanji!

137
00:09:39,780 --> 00:09:41,340
Thanks for counting on me.

138
00:09:41,580 --> 00:09:42,440
I mean it.

139
00:09:42,760 --> 00:09:43,900
That made me happy.

140
00:09:46,580 --> 00:09:47,720
Oh, wait!

141
00:09:48,260 --> 00:09:49,740
Watch the eyes!

142
00:09:50,440 --> 00:09:51,270
Yeah.

143
00:09:56,120 --> 00:09:57,400
Good luck, you two!

144
00:10:05,340 --> 00:10:07,180
Mice don't normally do that.

145
00:10:07,840 --> 00:10:09,997
It's from Father's surveillance team.

146
00:10:10,080 --> 00:10:11,257
They're known as the Marys.

147
00:10:11,340 --> 00:10:13,600
It's a cyborg, thus the smoke.

148
00:10:13,880 --> 00:10:15,351
They're modified animals.

149
00:10:15,600 --> 00:10:17,897
They've been fitted with
mechanical body parts.

150
00:10:17,980 --> 00:10:18,810
How strange!

151
00:10:19,480 --> 00:10:23,257
These creatures wander around the
island without a particular objective.

152
00:10:23,340 --> 00:10:25,281
But they can share what they see.

153
00:10:25,380 --> 00:10:27,145
And the human Marys take note.

154
00:10:27,960 --> 00:10:29,548
But where else could we go?

155
00:10:35,800 --> 00:10:37,565
Sure this is where they're at?

156
00:10:38,020 --> 00:10:41,537
Hard to say since no one's been
to this cursed place in ages.

157
00:10:41,620 --> 00:10:43,637
Doesn't look like
anyone's opened the door.

158
00:10:43,720 --> 00:10:44,620
Broken in even.

159
00:10:45,020 --> 00:10:47,140
Hey, we got nothing else to go on.

160
00:10:47,380 --> 00:10:49,297
Let's bust in there and find out!

161
00:10:49,380 --> 00:10:52,537
Kill the kid, and young Master
Yamato can be the next Shogun!

162
00:10:52,620 --> 00:10:54,177
It sounds like they sent a whole team.

163
00:10:54,260 --> 00:10:56,997
And if we stay here long,
they're only going to send more.

164
00:10:57,080 --> 00:10:58,139
Let's run, Yamato.

165
00:10:58,340 --> 00:11:02,987
Can you help us find a path that will
keep Lord Momonosuke out of their sights?

166
00:11:03,820 --> 00:11:05,460
We know you're in there!

167
00:11:05,660 --> 00:11:06,700
Come on out!

168
00:11:07,020 --> 00:11:08,960
Two Monkeys break down the door!

169
00:11:09,720 --> 00:11:10,800
One, two!

170
00:11:13,820 --> 00:11:15,240
We have to move, now!

171
00:11:15,560 --> 00:11:16,880
I'm sorry, Momonosuke.

172
00:11:17,420 --> 00:11:19,440
I need you to hide in my clothes.

173
00:11:20,700 --> 00:11:21,530
What?

174
00:11:34,100 --> 00:11:35,620
Time to go, Shinobu!

175
00:11:35,960 --> 00:11:39,078
I thought the idea was to
stay hidden from the enemy!

176
00:11:40,420 --> 00:11:41,480
Not to worry!

177
00:11:41,720 --> 00:11:44,779
We'll keep Momonosuke hidden
till we knock them out!

178
00:11:47,740 --> 00:11:50,660
That is not what I meant at all! Die!

179
00:11:55,360 --> 00:11:57,800
Uh, no need to worry, Master Jack.

180
00:11:58,000 --> 00:11:59,977
We're blocking this passage for you.

181
00:12:00,060 --> 00:12:02,000
You really should get some rest.

182
00:12:02,200 --> 00:12:03,040
Shut up!

183
00:12:03,340 --> 00:12:04,780
Out of my way!

184
00:12:05,840 --> 00:12:10,220
How long are the Akazaya Samurai
still in the treasure repository?

185
00:12:17,880 --> 00:12:19,540
They sure are!

186
00:12:20,220 --> 00:12:22,577
Black Maria, where are you?

187
00:12:22,660 --> 00:12:25,400
I'm still in the banquet hall.

188
00:12:26,840 --> 00:12:30,840
All right, stay there and I'll
finish off the samurai myself.

189
00:12:36,140 --> 00:12:39,500
Even if they're badly
injured, they're strong.

190
00:12:39,820 --> 00:12:42,740
Too strong to fall to one
of the Toby rope bone.

191
00:12:44,080 --> 00:12:46,820
This is my battle. Understand?

192
00:12:47,440 --> 00:12:50,220
Really underestimating
me, aren't you, Jack?

193
00:12:56,860 --> 00:12:58,297
But that's fine.

194
00:12:58,380 --> 00:13:00,440
It works out this time.

195
00:13:07,780 --> 00:13:10,660
The prey here is far more interesting.

196
00:13:14,640 --> 00:13:16,920
What is that thing? A weapon?

197
00:13:22,280 --> 00:13:25,157
It won't be long now, Nico Robin.

198
00:13:25,240 --> 00:13:27,217
Soon you'll belong to Kaido.

199
00:13:27,300 --> 00:13:29,340
I'll make sure of that.

200
00:13:30,560 --> 00:13:31,740
Not likely.

201
00:13:32,120 --> 00:13:33,767
You'd have to kill me first.

202
00:13:35,280 --> 00:13:36,920
She's so cool!

203
00:14:01,300 --> 00:14:05,880
A SPLENDID EFFORT,
WARRIORS OF THE FULL MOON!

204
00:14:12,840 --> 00:14:17,240
I pity your power is lickety
limited by the whims of the weather.

205
00:14:23,660 --> 00:14:24,540
Hydro!

206
00:14:29,660 --> 00:14:33,000
Listen, you Karoo must
keep moving forward!

207
00:14:34,160 --> 00:14:35,460
I can't die.

208
00:14:35,720 --> 00:14:38,100
I won't stop till I avenge Pedro.

209
00:14:41,740 --> 00:14:43,540
What are you avenging, girl?

210
00:14:43,860 --> 00:14:44,860
This is war.

211
00:14:45,140 --> 00:14:46,860
Pedro was prepared to die.

212
00:14:48,080 --> 00:14:51,560
Why did you come to Big Mom's
territory in the first place?

213
00:14:51,740 --> 00:14:54,799
Because it sure as hell
wasn't for a lickety picnic.

214
00:14:55,520 --> 00:14:58,477
If you want to live that
bad, you should stay home.

215
00:14:58,560 --> 00:15:00,700
Go frolicking in the damn forest.

216
00:15:07,160 --> 00:15:10,200
Your days of playing
Pirate are over, Bunny.

217
00:15:14,260 --> 00:15:19,142
Alright, I'm not fond of this lickety
alliance with the Beast Pirates, but oh well.

218
00:15:19,560 --> 00:15:22,600
If that's what Mama
decided, I have no choice.

219
00:15:23,220 --> 00:15:28,480
Besides, it's a good chance to teach those
worst generation punks a lickety lesson.

220
00:15:35,340 --> 00:15:37,380
And they're running!

221
00:15:37,880 --> 00:15:40,600
The enemy leader
Momonosuke is getting away!

222
00:15:40,940 --> 00:15:45,220
If nobody stops him,
there's gonna be trouble!

223
00:15:56,380 --> 00:15:59,757
He must be hiding Momonosuke somehow!

224
00:15:59,840 --> 00:16:02,640
I haven't been able to spot him yet.

225
00:16:02,840 --> 00:16:07,040
The Momonosuke is there with young
Master Yamato and the Kunoichi.

226
00:16:07,360 --> 00:16:08,580
I know it!

227
00:16:19,460 --> 00:16:23,277
It's cramped and difficult to
breathe in here, but never mind that.

228
00:16:23,360 --> 00:16:27,889
For some reason, even though my life is
in danger, I feel like I'm in heaven.

229
00:16:36,120 --> 00:16:37,640
Quick, Shinobu, this way.

230
00:16:37,920 --> 00:16:40,100
Of course, if they keep coming!

231
00:16:44,600 --> 00:16:46,637
Can you take us somewhere else, please?

232
00:16:46,720 --> 00:16:48,057
We need to get out of sight!

233
00:16:48,140 --> 00:16:49,258
It's under control.

234
00:16:49,460 --> 00:16:52,037
They can't see us once
they're unconscious, you know?

235
00:16:52,120 --> 00:16:56,944
If we could find a place to hide, then
they would never see us in the first place!

236
00:16:59,840 --> 00:17:01,740
Did you get that, everybody?

237
00:17:03,220 --> 00:17:06,920
Momonosuke has a speech from
the Forbidden Storehouse.

238
00:17:07,160 --> 00:17:09,925
He's with young Master
Yamato at the Konorichi.

239
00:17:11,260 --> 00:17:12,460
Without a doubt.

240
00:17:13,000 --> 00:17:14,680
Another broadcast, huh?

241
00:17:14,940 --> 00:17:17,352
Now they're going after Momo and Shinobu.

242
00:17:18,020 --> 00:17:19,620
But who is Yamato?

243
00:17:20,500 --> 00:17:21,480
Well, whatever.

244
00:17:22,400 --> 00:17:24,980
Hey, where's the Forbidden Storehouse?

245
00:17:25,400 --> 00:17:26,940
I'll never tell you.

246
00:17:27,940 --> 00:17:28,770
Yeah?

247
00:17:30,520 --> 00:17:31,350
Ugh!

248
00:17:31,433 --> 00:17:32,637
The front of the skull dome!

249
00:17:32,720 --> 00:17:34,779
It's right near the front entrance!

250
00:17:37,280 --> 00:17:40,337
Kinemon's group should be at
the back of the castle tower.

251
00:17:40,420 --> 00:17:41,400
What a pain.

252
00:17:41,900 --> 00:17:43,312
That's the opposite way.

253
00:17:45,820 --> 00:17:48,177
Kin'emon and the others are
injured from fighting Kaido.

254
00:17:48,260 --> 00:17:50,920
Momo and Shinobu are
being chased by gifters.

255
00:17:53,400 --> 00:17:55,237
I don't know who needs me more!

256
00:17:55,320 --> 00:17:56,920
How do I decide?

257
00:18:01,460 --> 00:18:03,000
No time to think about it.

258
00:18:03,540 --> 00:18:04,380
Let's see.

259
00:18:04,740 --> 00:18:07,622
Whoever needs me the most
has got to be this way.

260
00:18:20,380 --> 00:18:21,420
I can't.

261
00:18:28,900 --> 00:18:31,357
This blue flame draws out my strength.

262
00:18:31,440 --> 00:18:33,380
But it's all spent.

263
00:18:36,340 --> 00:18:37,680
There's nothing left.

264
00:18:41,820 --> 00:18:44,897
Keep fighting, dig deeper
than you ever have before.

265
00:18:44,980 --> 00:18:48,197
If you don't, the next time
you turn into an ice soda?

266
00:18:48,280 --> 00:18:50,060
You'll run wild till you die!

267
00:18:53,180 --> 00:18:55,817
This is no time to despair, young man.

268
00:18:55,900 --> 00:18:57,740
Stand up and show some courage.

269
00:18:58,920 --> 00:18:59,750
Mr.

270
00:18:59,833 --> 00:19:04,521
Raccoon is enduring the same pain as you,
but he's still working on those antidotes.

271
00:19:04,740 --> 00:19:06,622
We can't give up before he does.

272
00:19:09,180 --> 00:19:10,010
Boss?

273
00:19:10,093 --> 00:19:11,080
What happened to you?

274
00:19:15,300 --> 00:19:18,540
I've still got some fight
left, even if I'm old.

275
00:19:21,520 --> 00:19:23,980
A true samurai fights to the end!

276
00:19:24,260 --> 00:19:25,120
Stand back!

277
00:19:25,380 --> 00:19:27,027
I'll show you how it's done!

278
00:19:31,480 --> 00:19:32,920
Help, Apoo! Please!

279
00:19:33,160 --> 00:19:34,537
We can't win without you!

280
00:19:34,620 --> 00:19:36,057
The antibody's right there,

281
00:19:36,140 --> 00:19:39,417
but we can't break through their
defense no matter what we try!

282
00:19:39,500 --> 00:19:42,180
We're all going to die
at this rate, but why?

283
00:19:42,360 --> 00:19:44,066
We're on Master Queen's side!

284
00:19:44,460 --> 00:19:46,220
No point in whining about it.

285
00:19:46,420 --> 00:19:47,773
He doesn't give a damn!

286
00:19:48,080 --> 00:19:49,077
Damn, we're so close,

287
00:19:49,160 --> 00:19:53,160
all we gotta do is kill one measly
raccoon and the antibody is ours!

288
00:19:53,720 --> 00:19:54,840
Damn it, Drake!

289
00:19:55,280 --> 00:19:58,120
This is all your fault,
you stinkin' traitor!

290
00:19:59,180 --> 00:20:01,592
Stop pretending you're some kind of hero!

291
00:20:02,320 --> 00:20:05,637
Drake isn't the only problem
we're dealing with right now.

292
00:20:05,720 --> 00:20:08,249
The withered old man
got his strength back!

293
00:20:08,340 --> 00:20:10,693
Don't ask me how he pulled that one off.

294
00:20:11,960 --> 00:20:15,520
Everyone in Wano either
respected or feared this man.

295
00:20:16,160 --> 00:20:17,540
Hyogoro the flower.

296
00:20:20,400 --> 00:20:23,400
That's an iron-tight defense
if I've ever seen one.

297
00:20:23,620 --> 00:20:28,091
We're not getting anywhere near that
raccoon with both of them guarding him.

298
00:20:28,440 --> 00:20:29,911
What happened to Hyogoro?

299
00:20:30,140 --> 00:20:32,611
He was just a little old man a second ago!

300
00:20:33,300 --> 00:20:35,377
That's what he looked
like back in his prime,

301
00:20:35,460 --> 00:20:38,989
when Kaido was pounding down
his door trying to recruit him.

302
00:20:40,800 --> 00:20:42,537
Yeah, I can't stop shaking.

303
00:20:42,620 --> 00:20:44,420
Are you alright, boss?

304
00:20:44,660 --> 00:20:46,072
It's still you in there?

305
00:20:47,900 --> 00:20:48,730
Yes.

306
00:20:48,813 --> 00:20:51,360
I can feel the chill, but that's fine.

307
00:20:51,980 --> 00:20:54,940
My mind is sharp, and my body is ready.

308
00:20:57,180 --> 00:21:00,400
The virus got me, but not how I expected.

309
00:21:00,840 --> 00:21:05,660
It's drunk out all my strength,
down to the last inch of my life.

310
00:21:08,260 --> 00:21:10,560
If that's what it's come to, fine!

311
00:21:11,860 --> 00:21:15,400
I can put this final burst
of power to good use.

312
00:21:20,600 --> 00:21:23,540
In exchange for this life that I give,

313
00:21:23,860 --> 00:21:26,600
I'll cut down all of
their strongest fighters.

314
00:21:29,280 --> 00:21:31,420
Now come at me if you dare!

315
00:21:34,340 --> 00:21:37,300
Friends, listen closely. Yes!

316
00:21:37,480 --> 00:21:38,539
We're ready, boss!

317
00:21:42,500 --> 00:21:46,120
Win or lose, I don't think
I have much time left.

318
00:21:48,740 --> 00:21:50,200
There's a chance Mr.

319
00:21:50,340 --> 00:21:52,869
Raccoon's Cure won't
make it to me in time.

320
00:21:52,960 --> 00:21:55,607
In other words, I might
turn into a nice Oni.

321
00:21:56,320 --> 00:21:57,860
We can't have that.

322
00:21:59,900 --> 00:22:03,520
If it happens, cut me
down without hesitation.

323
00:22:05,540 --> 00:22:07,080
That's the only way.

324
00:22:07,420 --> 00:22:10,280
Otherwise, I'll go after you all.

325
00:22:10,560 --> 00:22:15,680
attacking like a wild animal and I
won't stop until you're dead at my feet.

326
00:22:16,680 --> 00:22:19,237
I could never; we must,

327
00:22:19,320 --> 00:22:23,438
and we must do it the instant he
begins to lose himself to the plague.

328
00:22:25,320 --> 00:22:28,100
If he becomes an oni,
he'll be unstoppable.

329
00:22:33,340 --> 00:22:34,937
I'm counting on you!

330
00:22:35,020 --> 00:22:39,657
Don't worry—we'll handle
him; we have a reputation.

331
00:22:39,740 --> 00:22:43,500
reputation We were the
Mimawari Kuma, after all.

332
00:22:44,840 --> 00:22:50,560
As for your tales of glory, we'll
consign them to the pages of history.

333
00:22:51,060 --> 00:22:52,340
Move it or die!

334
00:22:53,600 --> 00:22:55,220
Here we come!

335
00:23:14,040 --> 00:23:16,400
One sword style of the flower.

336
00:23:30,920 --> 00:23:32,220
Special technique.

337
00:23:40,180 --> 00:23:41,480
Slamming hair!

338
00:23:42,020 --> 00:23:44,480
Of Holy Rage!

339
00:23:46,660 --> 00:23:47,700
Goal!

340
00:24:05,820 --> 00:24:08,720
Everyone attack at once! Let's go!

341
00:24:18,500 --> 00:24:19,800
It's funny, Odin.

342
00:24:23,260 --> 00:24:25,560
I always think of what could have been.

343
00:24:30,080 --> 00:24:33,217
I can't help but wonder if
we might have beaten Kaido.

344
00:24:33,300 --> 00:24:35,947
If we'd challenged him
back when I was young.

345
00:24:48,400 --> 00:24:50,700
But there's no need for regrets.

346
00:24:51,660 --> 00:24:54,719
Kin'emon and the others have
executed a perfect raid.

347
00:24:57,540 --> 00:25:00,200
And I met a fascinating man.

348
00:25:00,640 --> 00:25:03,380
One who became my disciple, in a sense.

349
00:25:11,260 --> 00:25:12,280
Listen, Mr.

350
00:25:12,440 --> 00:25:15,680
Straw Hat, you have much
more potential to unlock.

351
00:25:16,100 --> 00:25:18,900
I'm certain that you'll see it in time.

352
00:25:19,660 --> 00:25:25,820
Remember, in the midst of danger
is when true power blossoms.

353
00:25:32,760 --> 00:25:35,540
If we team up, we can win this.

354
00:25:38,840 --> 00:25:40,420
Of course you can.

355
00:25:40,760 --> 00:25:43,857
I can punch through anything
now that you've taught me Ryu.

356
00:25:43,940 --> 00:25:46,980
This time I'll kick Kaido's sorry ass.

357
00:25:51,400 --> 00:25:56,340
Those were words of unshakable
conviction and I still believe them.

358
00:25:56,820 --> 00:26:00,517
He'll achieve mastery of
Ryu and become stronger.

359
00:26:00,600 --> 00:26:02,437
Kaido will fall.

360
00:26:02,520 --> 00:26:05,080
Your dream yet lives, Odin.

361
00:26:09,620 --> 00:26:13,057
The land of water will be reborn.

362
00:26:13,140 --> 00:26:16,360
A new dawn will come at last.

363
00:26:18,100 --> 00:26:20,097
Oh hell, no!

364
00:26:20,180 --> 00:26:22,460
He's gonna wipe out the whole floor!

365
00:26:26,360 --> 00:26:29,700
Suck on this, you old fart!

366
00:26:41,060 --> 00:26:42,900
He's not your only enemy here.

367
00:26:43,100 --> 00:26:44,041
Watch your back.

368
00:26:47,720 --> 00:26:48,550
Marco!

369
00:26:48,633 --> 00:26:50,060
The hell did you do to me?

370
00:26:50,260 --> 00:26:52,660
Was that a shockwave? I don't know.

371
00:26:52,860 --> 00:26:55,077
Keep fighting me and
maybe you'll find out.

372
00:26:55,160 --> 00:26:57,837
You won't lay a finger on
those samurai on my watch.

373
00:26:57,920 --> 00:27:00,626
If you want my head,
you'd better get to jump.

374
00:27:00,820 --> 00:27:04,140
You wanna jump in the frying pan? Fire!

375
00:27:04,400 --> 00:27:05,340
Help yourself!

376
00:27:07,420 --> 00:27:10,300
Go to hell, you stupid
chicken! Ah, nothing!

377
00:27:26,880 --> 00:27:27,710
Ha!

378
00:27:27,793 --> 00:27:28,640
Bluebird!

379
00:27:51,280 --> 00:27:55,697
you bastard you've had
enough fun i'm putting

380
00:27:55,780 --> 00:27:59,980
you down i'll use your
feathers to pick my teeth

381
00:28:19,300 --> 00:28:20,440
This ain't easy.

382
00:28:20,960 --> 00:28:23,577
Both these guys have
bounties worth over a billy.

383
00:28:23,660 --> 00:28:26,954
There's a limit to how long
I can keep holding them off.

384
00:28:32,820 --> 00:28:34,700
You're gonna pay him!

385
00:28:47,080 --> 00:28:49,040
You better hurry, Raccoon.

386
00:28:53,360 --> 00:28:55,080
What lickety-damn?

387
00:28:55,560 --> 00:28:58,060
I do believe that's Marco over there.

388
00:28:58,740 --> 00:29:01,280
Lickety looks like he's seen better days.

389
00:29:03,800 --> 00:29:04,630
Lick.

390
00:29:05,780 --> 00:29:08,920
They're turning back into
Oni one after another.

391
00:29:10,000 --> 00:29:10,900
It's gone!

392
00:29:11,360 --> 00:29:13,580
The fire went away!

393
00:29:23,880 --> 00:29:25,120
Do it.

394
00:29:25,400 --> 00:29:26,420
I'm not afraid.

395
00:29:35,100 --> 00:29:36,780
This is a blessing.

396
00:29:37,220 --> 00:29:39,240
A parting gift you might say.

397
00:29:40,000 --> 00:29:45,620
I thought that all I had left to do was
wait for death, and yet I came this far.

398
00:29:51,480 --> 00:29:53,400
Well, this is enough.

399
00:29:53,700 --> 00:29:56,880
I won't put your lives at
risk because I was careless.

400
00:29:57,260 --> 00:30:02,840
I'm sorry to give you such a grisly
task, but please do this for me.

401
00:30:11,320 --> 00:30:14,940
I leave Wano's future in your hands,

402
00:30:15,100 --> 00:30:19,420
so ends Yoguro the flower.

403
00:30:22,480 --> 00:30:24,800
I have no regrets.

404
00:30:25,800 --> 00:30:27,500
I am at peace.
